context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/rules/lists/{list_id}
Deletes a specific list and all its items.
Required: list_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/rules/lists/{list_id}
Fetches the details of a list.
Required: list_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/rules/lists/{list_id}/items/{item_id}
Fetches a list item in the list.
Required: item_id (path); list_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/rules/lists/bulk_operations/{operation_id}
Gets the current status of an asynchronous operation on a list. The `status` property can have one of the following values: `pending`, `running`, `completed`, or `failed`. If the status is `failed`, the `error` property will contain a message describing the error.
Required: operation_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/rules/lists/{list_id}
Updates the description of a list.
Required: list_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
